{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/strategize.png?t=1744758635\" />Carefully plan your route to be as efficient as possible. Avoid backtracking and load your van with delivery order in mind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/steamPageGifs_strategize.gif?t=1744758635\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/findShortcuts.png?t=1744758635\" />Explore the map during the route or using the practice mode to find secret paths along the way that could help save precious seconds. This could simply be a breakable fence, a ramp or even a fire hydrant used to clear blocks of houses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/steamPageGifs_findShortcuts.gif?t=1744758635\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/execute.png?t=1744758635\" />Time to take your crafted route to the test. Follow through with your plan and adjust it as needed, there's no shame in restarting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/steamPageGifs_Execute.gif?t=1744758635\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/practice.png?t=1744758635\" />Hone your package throwing skills in the training mode. Explore maps, routes and test strategies. You'll get detailed information about world position and velocities in this mode along with a package follow camera to track your trajectories.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/steamPageGifs_practice.gif?t=1744758635\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/reachTheTop.png?t=1744758635\" />Compete in online leaderboards. Crush your friends scores or set your sights on the #1 spot in the global rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/steamPageGifs_leaderboard.gif?t=1744758635\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2563790?t=1744758635","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744758635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/1e7e2e39589442277a22e5c4e7011ddd96a619b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744758635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/1e7e2e39589442277a22e5c4e7011ddd96a619b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744758635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/strategize.png?t=1744758635\" />Carefully plan your route to be as efficient as possible. Avoid backtracking and load your van with delivery order in mind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://share